{"id":"wb-6-1043","name":"白利寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"白利寺","text":"白利寺（藏语：བད་རི་དགོན་པ，威利转写：bad ri dgon pa），又称白日寺，位于四川省甘孜县，文物遗址年代判定为清。1980年7月7日列为四川省重新确定公布的第一批省级文物保护单位。2006年5月25日公布为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%99%BD%E5%88%A9%E5%AF%BA","revisionId":93283608,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93283608","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/d6b48b9ffd8937ad160fc9e7.jpg","title":"甘孜白利寺.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E7%94%98%E5%AD%9C%E7%99%BD%E5%88%A9%E5%AF%BA.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a2/%E7%94%98%E5%AD%9C%E7%99%BD%E5%88%A9%E5%AF%BA.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Nekitarc","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Baili Temple, Garze, Sichuan","width":320,"height":216}}